      ],
      "recommendation": "A, on all four axes: measured zero pull for a due-date timeline; overdue is record state that the field cell and the server already judge; nothing new for an AI to mis-author; and it retires a key with zero call sites at once instead of growing a declared surface. If the maintainer wants the capability later, B is the only correct route, and it starts in the spec."
